    label "public final boolean isDaemon()"
    type "method"
    comment "&#10;     * Tests if this thread is a daemon thread.&#10;     *&#10;     * @return  {@code true} if this thread is a daemon thread;&#10;     *          {@code false} otherwise.&#10;     * @see     #setDaemon(boolean)&#10;     "
  ]
